<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">RRK48.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 ABAKORINSO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha ya Kabiri ei Paulo yaahandiikiire Abakorinso</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Abakorinso</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Kor</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA YA KABIRI EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABAKORINSO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Paulo, entumwa ya Kristo Yesu nk'oku Ruhanga yaakunzire, na Timoseo ow'eishe-emwe, twabahandiikira imwe abari omu kanisa ya Ruhanga ey'omuri Korinso, hamwe n'abarikwera boona abari omuri Akaya yoona; <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />nitubendeza embabazi n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Tataitwe, na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okusiima ahabw'okukira akabi k'okufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Ruhanga asiimwe, Ishe wa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, Tataitwe ow'okusaasira, kandi Ruhanga ow'okuhuumuza kwona, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />otuhuumuza omu busaasi bwaitu bwona, ngu naitwe tubone kubaasa kuhuumuza abo abari omu busaasi bwona, nitubahuumuza n'obuhuumure obu tuhuumuzibwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:19">Zab 94:19</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba, nk'okubonabonesibwa kwa Kristo oku kwakanyire munonga omuriitwe, nikwo n'obuhuumure bwaitu omuri Kristo bwakanyire butyo. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:15">2 Kor 4:15</ref>. </char></note> Ku tureeba enaku, tuzireeba ngu imwe muhuumuzibwe, kandi mujunwe; ku tuhuumuzibwa, tuhuumura ngu mugire obuhuumure oburikureetwa okugumisiriza okubonabonesibwa, nkaitwe oku tubonabonesibwa. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Kandi tubainemu amatsiko tutarikubanganisa; ahakuba nitumanya ngu, nk'oku mukwatanisa naitwe omu kubonabonesibwa, nikwo mukwatanisa naitwe n'omu buhuumure.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:23">Byak 19:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, titurikwenda ngu mutamanya okubonabona okwatubaireho omuri Asia; ahakuba tukaremeerwa munonga okukira oku twakubaasize kwemera, kyatureetera kwehwa amatsiko ku tutakikira; <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />twateekateeka omu mitima yaitu ku tucwereirwe orubanja rw'okufa, ngu turekye kwesiga amaani gaitu twenka, kureka twesigye Ruhanga ozoora abafu. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:18">2 Tim 4:18</ref>. </char></note> Niwe yaatujunire omu kufa kwingi kutyo, kandi aryatujuna; niwe twinemu amatsiko ngu aryaguma naatujuna. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Naimwe mushemereire kukwatanisa kutuhwera omu kushaba kwanyu; ngu omugisha ogu twahairwe ahabw'okushaba kwa baingi, baingi bagusiimire Ruhanga ahabwaitu.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 2:17">2 Kor 2:17</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:17">1 Kor 1:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwehimbisa kwaitu nikwo oku, kandi n'eiraka ry'omwoyo gwaitu nirikuhamya, ngu emitwarize yaitu omu nsi, kandi okukira munonga omuriimwe, ekaba eri omu kwera n'omu mazima ga Ruhanga, etari mu bwengye bw'ensi, kureka omu mbabazi za Ruhanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Titurikubahandiikira bindi kureka ebyo ebi murikushoma, mukashoborokyerwa; kandi nyine amatisko ngu nimwija kubishoborokyerwa byona, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:12">2 Kor 5:12</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku mushoborokyeirwe ekicweka, ngu aha kiro kya Mukama waitu Yesu muryayehimbisa ahabwaitu, nk'oku naitwe turyehimbisa ahabwanyu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Omu matsiko ago nkaba niinyenda kuba niimwe naabanza kutaayaayira, ngu muheebwe omugisha kabiri, <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:5">1 Kor 16:5</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 16:6">6</ref>. </char></note> ndabe owaanyu ninza Makedonia, kandi omu kurugayo ngarukye ndabe owaanyu, mubone kunshendekyereza ninza Buyudaaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ku naateekateekire kukora ntyo, nkaba nk'orikugambira habiri? Nari ebi nteekateeka kukora, mbiteekateeka omu bwengye bw'abantu, ngu mbe orikwikiririza eryo, nti, Eego, Eego, nari Ngaaha, Ngaaha? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Nk'oku Ruhanga ari omwesigwa, ekigambo eki tubagambira tikiri Eego, kandi na Ngaaha; <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />ahakuba Omwana wa Ruhanga Yesu Kristo, ou twabarangiire, nyowe na Siluwaano na Timoseo, akaba atari Eego kandi na Ngaaha, kureka omuriwe obutoosha ni Eego. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:14">Kush 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba byona ebi Ruhanga yaaraganiise biba Eego omuriwe; kandi nikyo tugirira omuriwe tuti, Amiina, ngu Ruhanga ahimbisibwe omuriitwe. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:27">1 Yoh 2:27</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Ruhanga niwe atuhamya naimwe omuri Kristo, kandi akatushukaho amajuta; <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:5">2 Kor 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:13">Efe 1:13</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 1:14">14</ref>. </char></note> niwe yaatutaireho akamanyiso, akatuha omukwato gw'Omwoyo Orikwera omu mitima yaitu.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Kwonka Ruhanga niwe kareebi wangye, orikumanya omutima gwangye, ngu ekyanzibiire kwija Korinso n'ahabw'okubasaasira; <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:3">1 Pet 5:3</ref>. </char></note> ti habw'okubategyeka omu kwikiriza kwanyu, kureka nitukorera hamwe naimwe ahabw'okubareetera okushemererwa; ahabw'okuba mwemereziibwe okwikiriza.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 12:21">2 Kor 12:21</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:21">1 Kor 4:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo nkamariirira kimwe omu mutima gwangye kutagaruka waanyu nyine obusaasi. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Mbwenu, ku ndaabagwise kubi, n'oha orangwise gye? T'ogwo ou ngwisize kubi? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ekyo nkakihandiika ngu, ku ndiba naizire, ndekye kugwisibwa kubi abaakunshemeize, ahakuba nimbeesiga mwena ngu okushemererwa kwangye kukaabaire okwanyu mwena. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:31">Byak 20:31</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu nkabahandiikira nyine enaku n'obusaasi bwingi omu mutima, kandi n'amarira maingi, ti habw'okwenda ngu muguubwe kubi, kureka okubamanyisa okukunda kwingi oku ndikubakunda. <verse eid="2CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ku haraabe hariho owaareetsire okushaasha, tiinye yaasaasize, kureka haihi mwena, ntakaarengyesereza nti, akasaasa mwena. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Ekiheneso omushaija ogwo eki yaahairwe abarikukira obwingi nikimara; <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />nikyo kibashemerereire kumusaasira n'okumuhuumuza, ngu shana atakaarengwa obusaasi. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />N'ahabw'ekyo nimbeeshengyereza ngu mugarukye muhamye ku murikumukunda. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:15">2 Kor 7:15</ref>. </char></note> Ekindi ekindeeteire kuhandiika n'okubagyeza, ngu mmanye ku muraabe nimworoba omuri byona. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Omuntu weena ou musaasira, naanye mmusaasira; naanye eki naasaasiire, ku kiraabe kiriho, nkakimusaasira ahabwanyu omu maisho ga Kristo, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:31">Luk 22:31</ref>. </char></note> Sitaane arekye kutugobeza, ahabw'okuba tituri batarikumanya bwengye bwe obu arikutucwera.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 16:9">1 Kor 16:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naizire Troa kubuurirayo engiri ya Kristo, naashanga Mukama anyiguriireho orwigi; <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />kwonka tindagizire kuhuumura omu mutima gwangye ahabw'okutashangayo ow'eishe-emwe Tito. Nikwo kubaraga, nkagumizamu kutaaha Makedonia.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Ruhanga asiimwe, otutabaarura obutoosha, turi abasinguzi omuri Kristo, kandi otuha okubuzya hoona eby'okumumanya, ngu bibe nk'okutaamirana kw'omugaju. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:18">1 Kor 1:18</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba itwe turi omugaju gwa Kristo ahari Ruhanga omu bantu abarikujunwa n'omu barikuhwerekyerera; <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:34">Luk 2:34</ref>. </char></note> aha barikuhwerekyerera, turi omugaju gw'okufa ogureeta okufa, kwonka aha barikujunwa turi omugaju ogw'amagara ogureeta amagara. Mbwenu ebyo n'oha orikubibaasa? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:11">1 Pet 4:11</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba tituri nk'abandi baingi abashuubuza Ekigambo kya Ruhanga kukiihamu enshaagi; kureka itwe turi ab'amazima, tutumwa Ruhanga, kandi tugambira omuri Kristo omu maisho ga Ruhanga.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Abaheereza b'Endagaano nsya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:12">2 Kor 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:27">Byak 18:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimugira ngu twatandika kugaruka kwehimbisa? Nari shi, nitwetenga ebaruha z'okutusiimisa, ezi muhandiikiirwe, nari ezi muhandiikire, nk'oku abandi beetenga? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:2">1 Kor 9:2</ref>. </char></note> Imwe mwenka niimwe baruha y'okutusiimisa, ehandiikirwe omu mitima yaanyu, erikumanywa kandi ekashomwa abantu boona; <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Kur 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:19">Ezk 11:19</ref>. </char></note> kandi nimureebeka muri ebaruha ya Kristo ei yaatuhandiikise, etahandiikirwe na bwino, kureka n'Omwoyo wa Ruhanga ohuriire, hatari ha bishate by'amabaare, kureka aha mbari z'emitima y'abantu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Obu nibwo bwesigye obu twesiga Ruhanga ahabwa Kristo; <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />ahakuba itwe titwine ki turikwebaasiza twenka, kuteekateeka ekintu kyona ngu niitwe kirugireho; kureka okubaasa kwaitu kuruga ahari Ruhanga, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Yer 31:31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:63">Yoh 6:63</ref>. </char></note> niwe yaatubaasiise kuba abaheereza b'endagaano nsya, etari y'ebihandiiko, kureka ey'Omwoyo; ahakuba ey'ebihandiiko eita, kwonka Omwoyo areeta amagara.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:30">Kur 34:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimumanya ngu obuheereza oburikureeta okufa okw'omu bihandiiko ebyatonirwe aha bishate by'amabaare, bukaija n'ekitiinisa kingi, n'okuzibira kyazibira Abaisraeli kureeba ahamaisho ga Musa ahabw'okumurinkana kwago, okwabaire kuri okw'okuhwaho; <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />nimugira ngu obuheereza obw'Omwoyo tiburiija n'ekitiinisa ekirikukiraho? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">Rom 1:17</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo obuheereza oburikusingisa orubanja ku buraabe bwagizire ekitiinisa, obuheereza oburikuhaisa okuhikiirira buryagira ekitiinisa ekirikukiraho. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:29">Kur 34:29</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu obuheereza, obwabaire bwine ekitiinisa, tibukikiine, ahabw'okuba ekitiinisa kyabwo kikamarwaho eky'obwo oburikubukira. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Oburikuhwaho ku buraabe bwagizire ekitiinisa, obutahwaho buryagira ekitiinisa ekirikukiraho.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Nk'oku twine amatsiko agarikwingana gatyo, nitugamba n'obumanzi bwingi; <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Kur 34:33</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:35">35</ref>. </char></note> ti nka Musa oku yaataire eky'okwetwekyerera ahamaisho ge, ngu Abaisraeli batareeba omuheru gw'ekitiinisa ekyabaire nikihwaho. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:25">Rom 11:25</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka emitima yaabo ekagangaazibwa; ahakuba n'okuhitsya eri izooba ku bashoma endagaano eya ira, hoona eky'okwetwekyerera ekyo kigumaho kitashuurwirwe; ahabw'okuba omuri Kristo wenka nimwo kiihirwaho; <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />ahakuba obutoosha ku bashoma ebya Musa, eky'okwetwekyerera ekyo kiguma aha mitima yaabo n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:23">Rom 11:23</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 11:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omuntu ku ahindukira Mukama, eky'okwetwekyerera ekyo kiihwaho. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:36">Yoh 8:36</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:2">Rom 8:2</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu Mukama waitu niwe Mwoyo; kandi ahu Omwoyo wa Mukama ari, niho obusingye buri. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Itwe twena ku turaabe nitworeka ekitiinisa kya Mukama ahamaisho gaitu, twaba nk'endeeberwamu, obwo ahamaisho gaitu ahatatwekyereire, tuguma nituhindurwa okushushana nawe, nituruga omu kitiinisa kuza omu kitiinisa ekindi ekirikukiraho; ebyo nibiruga ahari Mukama niwe Mwoyo.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Engiri ya Kristo nk'Omushana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />N'ahabw'ekyo, nk'oku tuhairwe obuheereza obu ahabw'embabazi za Ruhanga, titurikuhwa matsiko. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:5">1 Tes 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Tukanga eby'enshoni ebirikukorerwa omu mwirima, titurikugyendera omu bugobya, n'obu kwakuba okuhindura okundi ekigambo kya Ruhanga; kureka tworeka amazima, ngu omuntu weena atusiimise omutima omu maisho ga Ruhanga. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:18">1 Kor 1:18</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka engiri ei tugamba ku eraabe etwekyereirwe, etwekyereirwe aha barikuhwerekyerera; <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:2">Efe 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:11">2 Tes 2:11</ref>. </char></note> nibo batarikwikiriza, abu ruhanga ow'ensi egi yaahumize emitima, ngu omushana gw'engiri y'ekitiinisa kya Kristo, niwe kishushani kya Ruhanga, gutabaakira. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Mumanye ngu titurikwegambaho nk'abakama, kureka nitugamba Yesu Kristo ku niwe Mukama, kandi itwe turi abahuuku baanyu ahabwa Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ahakuba Ruhanga, owaaragiire ati: Omushana gujwe omu mwirima, Ogwo niwe yaajwire omu mitima yaitu kutuha okushoborokyerwa ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga ekirikureeberwa omuri Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obusaasi bw'Entumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:26">1 Kor 1:26</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 1:31">31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka obutungi obu tubwine omu nyabya z'eibumba, okworeka ngu amaani agarikukirira kimwe n'aga Ruhanga, ti gaitu. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:5">2 Kor 7:5</ref>. </char></note> Tukubirwe embaju zoona, kwonka titufunziibwe; nitushoberwa, kwonka titurikuhwa matsiko; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />nituhiigwa, kwonka titurikutsigwaho; twikarirwa, kwonka titugwaho; <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />obutoosha tugyenda twine okufa kwa Yesu omu mibiri yaitu, ngu amagara ge gareebekyere omu mibiri yaitu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:36">Rom 8:36</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba itwe abahuriire tuheebwayo obutoosha okufa ahabwa Yesu, ngu amagara ga Yesu goorekwe omu mibiri yaitu erikufa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />N'ahabw'ekyo okufa kukorera omuriitwe, kwonka amagara gakorera omuriimwe.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:10">Zab 116:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku twine omwoyo gw'okwikiriza nk'ogw'ogwo owaahandiikire ati: Nkaikiriza, nikyo naagambiire, naitwe nitwikiriza, nikyo turikugambira; <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:14">1 Kor 6:14</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba nitumanya ngu Owaazoire Mukama waitu Yesu aryatuzoora hamwe nawe, atuhitsye omu maisho ge hamwe naimwe. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ahakuba byona biri ahabwanyu, ngu, nk'oku embabazi zibugire omu bantu abarikweyongyera kuba baingi, zibe nikwo zaakanyisa okusiima, Ruhanga abone kuhimbisibwa.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 3:16">Efe 3:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo titurikuhwa matsiko. N'obu omuntu waitu w'aharuguru ahwaho, kwonka omuntu waitu ow'omunda ahindurwa musya obutoosha. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:18">Rom 8:18</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu obusaasi bwaitu bukye, obw'omwanya mukye ogu, bweyongyera obutoosha kututeekateekyera ekitiinisa kingi munonga ekitahwaho, <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:27">Heb 12:27</ref>. </char></note> itwe ku tuba tutahangire maisho ebirikureebwa, kureka ebitarikureebwa; ahakuba ebirikureebwa n'eby'okuhwaho juba, kwonka ebitarikureebwa n'eby'ebiro byona.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:13">2 Pet 1:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nitumanya ngu enju yaitu ey'orusiisira, ei tutuuramu omu nsi egi, ku erisheenywa, twine ekyombeko ekirikuruga ahari Ruhanga, enju ey'omu iguru, etombekirwe mikono, ey'ebiro n'ebiro. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:23">Rom 8:23</ref>. </char></note> N'ekya buzima omuri egi nitutsinda, nitwetenga kujwara eyaitu ey'omu iguru, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />ku turiba nitugijwekwa, turekye kushangwa tujwaire busha. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:53">1 Kor 15:53</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba itwe abakiri omu nju egi ey'orusiisira nitutsinda turemeirwe, ti habw'okwenda kujuurwa, kureka okwongyera kujwekwa, ngu eky'okufa kimirwe amagara. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Kandi owaatuteekateekyeire ekyo ni Ruhanga, kandi niwe yaatuhaire omukwato gw'Omwoyo. <verse eid="2CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:13">Heb 11:13</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo nikyo kitugumya omutima obutoosha; nitumanya ngu ku tuba tukiri owaitu omu mubiri, tuba turi hare na Mukama waitu; <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />(ahakuba tugyenda ahabw'okwikiriza, ti habw'okureeba.) <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:23">Fil 1:23</ref>. </char></note> Tuguma omutima; kwonka eki turikukira kukunda n'eki, okutaana n'omubiri, tukataaha omuka owa Mukama waitu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Nikyo twezirikira kumushemeza, yaaba turi owaitu omuka, yaaba tutariyo. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:16">Rom 2:16</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu twena tushemereire kwemerera omu maisho g'ekitebe kya Kristo eky'okucweraho emanja, ngu omuntu weena abone kuheebwa ekishemereire ebi yaakozire omu mubiri, yaaba kirungi nari kibi.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Ahabw'okumanya ku Mukama aba ow'okutiinwa, twikiririsa abantu; kwonka Ruhanga niwe amanya oku turi; kandi nyine amatsiko ngu naimwe nimumanya oku turi omu mitima yaanyu. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Titurikugaruka kwehimbisa ahariimwe, kureka nitubaha oburyo bw'okwehimbisa ahabwaitu, ngu mubaase kugarukamu abarikwehimbisiza aha birikureebwa kwonka, bitari by'omu mutima. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ku turaabe tugwire eiraro, turigwire ahabwa Ruhanga; ku turaabe tuhuriire, tuhuriire ahabwanyu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ahakuba okukunda kwa Kristo nikwo kutugyema, nitumanyira kimwe ngu Omwe akafeera boona; nahabw'ekyo boona bakafa. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:7">Rom 14:7</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 14:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eki yaafeereire ahabwa boona n'eki; akafa ngu abariho barekye kuguma bariho ahabwabo bonka, kureka ahabw'Ogwo owaabafeereire akabazookyera.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Entumwa za Kristo okuteerana hamwe abantu na Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Mbwenu okuruga hati titukimanya muntu weena omu buzaare bw'omubiri. N'obu turaabe twamanyire Kristo, nk'oku abantu baamumanyire, mbwenu titukimumanya tutyo. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:15">Gal 6:15</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omuntu weena, ku aba ari omuri Kristo, aba ari ekihangirwe kisya; ebya kare biba bihweire, reeba byona biba bihindukire bisya. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:10">Rom 5:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka byona biruga ahari Ruhanga, owaatwegaruririire omuri Kristo, akatuha omurimo gw'okugarukanisa abantu na Ruhanga; <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Kol 1:20</ref>. </char></note> ekirikushoboororwa ngu Ruhanga akaba ari omuri Kristo naayegarurira abari omu nsi, atakibabarira by'okushiisha byabo, kandi naitwe yaatukwatsa ekigambo ky'okugarukanisa okwo. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Mbwenu turi entumwa omu mwanya gwa Kristo, Ruhanga naashusha nk'orikweshengyereza abantu omuriitwe. Naitwe nitubeeshengyereza omu iziina rya Kristo, mugarukane na Ruhanga; <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:13">Gal 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:30">1 Kor 1:30</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:9">Fil 3:9</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Ogwo otaramanyire kibi Ruhanga akamuhindura ekibi ahabwaitu, ngu omuriwe tuhindukye okuhikiirira kwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okubonabona ahabw'Engiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Naitwe, nk'oku turi abarikukora nawe, nitubeeshengyereza, murekye kufiisa busha embabazi za Ruhanga; <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Isa 49:8</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba We agira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Omu bunaku bw'okwikiririzibwamu nkakuhurira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Kandi aha izooba ry'okujunirwaho naakuhwera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Reeba, hati nibwo bunaku bw'okwikiririzibwamu buzima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Reeba, hati niryo izooba ry'okujunirwaho.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Nikyo twerindira kutateeza omuntu weena ntsibo, ngu obuheereza bwaitu burekye kugaywa, <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />kureka omuri byona nitweyoreka nk'abashemereire kuba abaheereza ba Ruhanga, nitugumisiriza munonga omu kubonabona, omu bworo, omu busaasi, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:23-27">2 Kor 11:23-27</ref>. </char></note> omu kuteerwa enkoba, omu kuteebwa omu bihome, omu kujagarara, omu kufa kubi, omu kuraara aha kiro, n'omu kwesiibyakwo; <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:12">1 Tim 4:12</ref>. </char></note> nitumuheereza omu kwera, omu bwengye, omu kugumisiriza, omu mbabazi, omu Mwoyo Orikwera, omu kukunda okutarimu buryarya, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />omu kigambo ky'amazima, n'omu maani ga Ruhanga; tukwaitse eby'okurwanisa by'okuhikiirira omu mukono gwa buryo n'ogwa bumosho; <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />omu kitiinisa n'omu kugaywa, omu kugambwaho kubi n'omu kugambwaho gye; nituteekyerezibwaho nk'abanyabishuba, kunu turi ab'amazima; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:18">Zab 118:18</ref>. </char></note> nk'abatarikumanywa, haza nitumanywa; nk'abarikufa, haza turi abahuriire; nk'abarikubonabonesibwa, kwonka tutaitsirwe; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />nk'abaine obusaasi, kwonka nitushemererwa obutoosha; nk'abooro, haza nitutungisa baingi; nk'abataine kantu, haza twine byona.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukristaayo okwetaanisa n'ab'ensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 4:29">1 Bag 4:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe Bakorinso 'mwe, akanwa kaitu kaabamarirayo, twabashashaanurira emitima yaitu. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Timufunzire muriitwe, kureka mufunzire omu mitima yaanyu. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Nimbagambira nk'abaana bangye, naimwe mushashaanukye, mukore nk'oku mwagiriirwe.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:11">Efe 5:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutakwatanisa n'abatarikwikiriza, abu mutaine nabo kakwate. Okuhikiirira n'okutahikiirira biine kakwate ki? Nari omushana n'omwirima nibikwatanisa bita? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Nari Kristo naakwatanisa ata na Beliali? Orikwikiriza aine mugabo ki n'otarikwikiriza? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:27">Ezk 37:27</ref>. </char></note> Hekalu ya Ruhanga neikirizana eta n'ebishushani ebiramibwa? Ahakuba itwe turi hekalu ya Ruhanga ohuriire, nk'oku yaagizire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Ndyabatuuramu, mbagyendagyendemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Ndyaba Ruhanga waabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Nabo babe abantu bangye.<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:4">Kush 18:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo mubarugyemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Mubeetaaniseho; nikwo Mukama arikugira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Mutarikora aha kintu kyona ekitashemeire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Obwo naanye ndyabaakiira,<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Isa 43:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ndyaba Shoimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">Naimwe mube batabani bangye na bahara bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">Nikwo Mukama ow'obushoboorozi bwona arikugira.<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Nk'oku twine ebyaraganisiibwe ebyo, abarikukundwa, tweyozyeho oburofa bwona obw'aha mubiri n'obw'omu mwoyo, nituhikiiriza okwera omu kutiina Ruhanga.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:33">Byak 20:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mmutwakiire omu mitima yaanyu; tihariho muntu weena ou twakozire kubi, tihariho ou twasiisire, tihariho ou twagobeize. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Tindikugamba ekyo kubacwera orubanja; ahakuba nkabagambira kare, ku muri omu mitima yaitu okufa hamwe naitwe, kandi n'okuguma naitwe turi abahuriire. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Nimbeesiga buzima; niinyehimbisa munonga ahabwanyu; nyijwire obuhuumure; nangwa n'omu busaasi bwaitu bwona nyine okushemererwa okushaagire.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwefuuza okurimu okutiina Ruhanga, n'okw'ensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />N'obu twahikire Makedonia, emibiri yaitu teraboine kuhuumura na kakye, kureka tukagira obusaasi embaju zoona; aheeru hakaba hariyo engamba, omunda harimu obwoba. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:13">2 Kor 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Ruhanga, ohuumuza enshoberwa, akatuhuumuza ahabw'okwija kwa Tito; <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />kandi ti kwija kwe kwonka, kureka n'okuhuumuzibwa oku yaahuumuziibwe omuriimwe, ku yaatuteekyerereize orushusho rwanyu oru munyiniire, n'okurira kwanyu n'obweziriki bwanyu ahabwangye; nikyo kyandeeteire kweyongyera kushemererwa. <verse eid="2CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:4">2 Kor 2:4</ref>. </char></note> N'obu ndaabe naabareeteire obusaasi ahabw'ebaruha ei naabahandiikiire, tindikwefuuza, (n'obu ndaabe naabandize kwefuuza); ekyanyefuuriise n'okureeba ngu ebaruha egyo ekabasaasa, n'obu muraabe mwasaasire omwanya mukye. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Kwonka hati ninshemererwa, ti habw'okushaasha kwanyu, kureka ahabw'okushaasha oku mwagizire kukabareetera okweteisa; ahakuba mukashaasha omu buryo bwa Ruhanga, ngu mutagira eki mwafeerwa ahabwaitu. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:3-5">Mat 27:3-5</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu okwefuuza okurimu kutiina Ruhanga kureeta okweteisa okutarikwefuuzibwa, okurikuhitsya aha kujunwa; kwonka okwefuuza okw'ensi kureeta okufa. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Mbwenu mureebe okwefuuza oku okw'omu buryo bwa Ruhanga oku kwabareeteire okutaho munonga omutima, kukabareetera okwetonganira, n'okutamwa, n'obwoba, n'okwetenga, n'obweziriki, n'okuhana abarikushobya! Omuri byona mukeeyoreka ku mutaine rubanja omu kigambo ekyo. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />N'obu naabahandiikiire, tindabahandiikiire ahabw'ogwo owaasiisire, nari shi ahabw'ogwo owaasiisirwe, kureka ngu mushuuruurirwe obweziriki bwanyu oku buri ahabwaitu omu maisho ga Ruhanga.<verse eid="2CO 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />N'ahabw'ekyo tukahuumuzibwa; kandi omu buhuumure obwo twayeyongyera kushemererwa munonga ahabw'okushemererwa kwa Tito, ahakuba mwena mukaruhuura omwoyo gwe. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ku ndaabe naamugambiire ekigambo kyona eky'okwehimbisa ahabwanyu, tindakwatsirwe nshoni; kwonka nk'oku twabagambiire byona omu mazima, nikwo n'okwehimbisa kwaitu ahari Tito kwashangirwe kuri okw'amazima. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ku aijuka oku mwamworobeire mwena, mukamwakiira mwine obwoba n'okutetema, omutima gwe gweyongyera kubakunda. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Naanye ninshemererwa, ahabw'okuba omuri byona ngumire omutima ahabwanyu.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okusiima Abamakedonia ahabw'okugaba kwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:26">Rom 15:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, nitubamanyisa embabazi za Ruhanga ezaayorekirwe omu makanisa ag'omuri Makedonia. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Ku baabaire nibakigyezibwa okubonabonesibwa kwingi, okushemererwa kwabo okuhinguraine, n'obworo bwabo bwingi, bikakanya, byabareetera okugaba bingi munonga nk'abatungi. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ahakuba nimpamya ngu, bakagaba beekundiire nk'oku baabaasize, nangwa n'okukiraho, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:29">Byak 11:29</ref>. </char></note> nibatushaba n'okweshengyereza kwingi okwikirizibwa kukwatanisa n'abarikuhwera abarikwera. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Kandi tibarakozire nk'oku twabaire nituteekateeka, kureka bakabanza kwehayo ahari Mukama n'ahariitwe, nk'oku Ruhanga yaakunzire. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Nikyo twayehanangiririize Tito ngu, nk'oku yaatandikire ira, abe nikwo yaahikiiriza omuriimwe omurimo ogu ogw'embabazi. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:5">1 Kor 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:1">16:1</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 16:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka, nk'oku murikuhingurana omuri byona, omu kwikiriza, omu kugamba, omu bwengye, omu bweziriki bwona, n'omu kukunda oku murikutukunda, mube nikwo mwahingurana n'omu murimo ogu ogw'embabazi.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ekyo tindikukigamba nk'orikuragiira, kureka niinyenda kuhamya okukunda kwanyu ku kuraabe kuri okw'amazima, niinyihirira aha bweziriki bw'abandi. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:20">Mat 8:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nimumanya embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo; n'obu yaabaire ari omutungi, kwonka akahinduka omworo ahabwanyu, ngu obworo bwe bubatungise. <verse eid="2CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Omuri eki nimbagambira eki ndikuteekateeka; imwe abaabandiize abandi kutandika, hahingwire omwaka, kibashemereire kukora; kandi ti kukora kwonka, kureka okukora n'okukunda. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Kwonka hati mbwenu mwongyereho kuhikiiriza okukora okwo; nk'oku mwayeteekateekire kukikunda, mube nikwo mwakihikiiriza n'ei mwine. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:43">Mak 12:43</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ahu okukunda kuri, nikwikirizibwa nk'oku omuntu aine, ti nk'oku ataine. <verse eid="2CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Tindikugamba ntyo kwanguhiza abandi, ngu imwe muremeerwe; <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:12">2 Kor 9:12</ref>. </char></note> kureka ngu mwingaingane; ebi mushaagize omu biro ebi bimare obworo bwabo, kandi nabo ebi barishaazya biije bimare obworo bwanyu, mubone kwingaingana; <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Kur 16:18</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Owaashangurwize bingi, taine ki yaashaagizeho; n'owaashangurwize bikye, taine ki yaakyenire.<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Kwonka Ruhanga asiimwe, owaataire omu mutima gwa Tito obweziriki nk'obu nyine ahabwanyu. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Ahakuba taraikiriize kwija ahabw'okushaba kwaitu kwonka, kureka ahabw'obweziriki obu aine ahabwe naija kwija owaanyu ahabw'okwekundira. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Kandi nitwija kumutuma hamwe n'ow'eishe-emwe, orikusiimwa omu makanisa goona ahabw'okubuurira engiri kwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />T'ekyo kyonka; kandi hoona akatooranwa amakanisa kugyenda naitwe omu murimo ogu ogw'embabazi, itwe ogu turikukora kuhaisa Mukama ekitiinisa, kandi n'okworeka okukunda kwaitu. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Nitwerinda ngu hatagira owaatubeiherera ahabw'ekiconco eki ekihango, eki turikuheereza; <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:4">Enf 3:4</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba eki turikugyenderera n'okukora ebirikusiimwa, ti mu maisho ga Mukama kwonka, kureka n'omu maisho g'abantu. <verse eid="2CO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Kandi hamwe nabo nitutuma ow'eishe-emwe ondiijo ou tugyerize kaingi, tukashanga ari omweziriki omuri bingi, kandi hati n'omweziriki okukira oku yaabaire ari, ahabw'okuba naabeesiga munonga. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:13">2 Kor 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 12:18">12:18</ref>. </char></note> Ebya Tito mumanye ngu ni mugyenzi wangye ou turikukora hamwe, kandi ou tukwataniise kubaheereza; kandi eby'ab'eishe-emwe abo n'entumwa z'amakanisa ezihimbisisa Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />N'ahabw'ekyo muboorekye ebirikuhamya okukunda kwanyu, kandi n'okwehimbisa kwaitu ahabwanyu omu maisho g'amakanisa.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Oku Omukristaayo ashemereire kuba efura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Aha by'okuhwera abarikwera tindikureeba ki ndikubahandiikirira; <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />ahakuba nimmanya okukunda kwanyu, oku ndikweraata ahabwanyu omu Bamakedonia, ningira nti: Abaakaya bamazire omwaka beeteekateekire; kandi obweziriki bwanyu bwezirikiise baingi munonga aharibo. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Kwonka nintuma ab'eishe-emwe abo ngu okwehimbisa kwaitu ahabwanyu omu kigambo ekyo kutaba kwa busha, kureka babashangye mweteekateekire, nk'oku naagambire; <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />ahakuba tindikwenda itwe, (tutagizire imwe) kukwatwa nshoni z'ebyo ebi tubainemu matsiko, Abamakedonia bamwe batakaija naanye, bakashanga muteeteekateekire. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Nikyo naateekateekyeire ngu kishemereire kweshengyereza ab'eishe-emwe abo kumbandiza okwo, ngu bateekateekye kare ekiconco kyanyu eki mwaraganiise, ira, ngu kishangwe kyatebeekanisiibwe, kiri eky'embabazi, kitari ky'okugyemwa.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 19:17">Enf 19:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki ndikugamba n'eki, ngu, Orikubiba nkye, aryagyesha bikye; kandi orikubiba nyingi, aryagyesha bingi. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:8">Rom 12:8</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:17">1 Bus 29:17</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena akore, nk'oku amaririire omu mutima gwe, atarikunyoomwa nari akugyemwa; ahakuba Ruhanga akunda efura. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Ruhanga naabaasa kubakanyisiza emigisha yoona, ngu imwe, ku muraatungye obutoosha ebirikubamara, mubone kugira bingi eby'okuhwera omurimo gwona omurungi. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Zab 112:9</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">Akateera hoona embibo, yaagabira abooro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">Okuhikiirira kwe nikugumaho ebiro byona.<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 10:12">Hos 10:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Ogwo orikuha omubibi embibo, akamuha eby'okurya, aryabaha embibo z'okubiba, azikanyise, kandi akanyise n'ebyana by'okuhikiirira kwanyu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Naimwe omuri byona muryatungisibwa munonga, mubone kugira obufura oburisiimisa Ruhanga ahabwaitu; <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />ahakuba okuheereza eby'okuhwera ebyo tikurikumara bworo bw'abarikwera kwonka, beitu kandi nikureetera baingi okukiraho kusiima Ruhanga; <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />ahabw'okuba omu kugyezibwa okw'okuheereza oku, Ruhanga naija kuhimbisibwa ahabw'okworoba kwanyu oku mwayorobeire engiri ya Kristo, kandi n'obufura bwanyu omu bintu ebi mwahaire ahabw'abo n'ahabw'abandi boona; <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />kandi baryabagirira orushusho, nibabashabira ahabw'embabazi za Ruhanga ezihinguraine omuriimwe. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Ruhanga asiimwe ahabw'ekiconco kye ekitarikubaasa kushoboororwa.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 2:3">1 Kor 2:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe Paulo nimbeeshengyereza ahabw'obucureezi n'okutwaza gye ebya Kristo, oku mungambaho muti: Ku aba ari omu maisho gaitu, aba omucureezi; ku aba aturi hare, aba emanzi. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Nimbeeshengyereza nti: Ku ndiija owaanyu, ndekye kugyemwa kukoresa obumanzi, nk'oku nshemereire kubukoresa aha bantu bamwe abarikututeekateekaho ngu tutwaza nk'abantu nyabuntu. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ahakuba n'obu turaabe nitugyenda, turi abantu abaine omubiri, kwonka titurikurwana nitutwaza nk'abanyamubiri; <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Efe 6:13-17</ref>. </char></note> mumanye ngu eby'okurwanisa by'orugamba rwaitu ti by'abantu, kureka n'eby'amaani ga Ruhanga okusheenya ebigo, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />nitumaraho tutyo empaka n'ekintu kyona ekirikwetunguura kurwanisa okumanya Ruhanga, kandi nitugomoora ekiteekateeko kyona, ngu kyorobere Kristo; <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />kandi nikwo tweteekateekire kuhana okutahurira kwona, okworoba kwanyu ku kuraabe kuhikire.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okuhamya obukuru obu yaahairwe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Mureebe ebiri omu maisho gaanyu. Omuntu weena ku araabe naayesiga ngu n'owa Kristo, aijukye ngu, nk'oku we ari owa Kristo, naitwe nikwo turi. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:4">1 Kor 5:4</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 5:5">5</ref>. </char></note> N'obu naakurenzya aha kwehimbisa ahabw'obushoboorozi obu Mukama yampaire kubombeka, kutari kubasheenya, tinkaakwatwa nshoni. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Nyowe tinkwenzire kushusha nk'orikubatiinisa n'ebaruha zangye. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ahakuba nibagira bati: Ebaruha ze zigumire kandi n'ez'amaani; kwonka ku aba ariho, areebeka ari omweremwa, n'ebigambo bye biri ebirikugaywa. <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:2">2 Kor 13:2</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 13:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Abarikugamba batyo bamanye ngu, eki tuhandiika omu baruha tutariho, hoona nikyo tukora twaba turiho. <verse eid="2CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Itwe titurikwehanga kwebarira omu bantu bamwe abarikwehimbisa, nari okweringaaniza nabo; bo ku beegyera aha rugyero rwabo bonka, kandi bayegyeranisa bonka, baba bataine ki barikumanya.<verse eid="2CO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:3">Rom 12:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka itwe titurikwija kwehimbisa okukira oku turi, kureka okugumira aha rugyero oru Ruhanga yaatuhaire, ngu tubone kuhika ahariimwe. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Titurikukununkirira okurenga orugyero orwo, nk'abatarabahikire; ahakuba niitwe twabandize kuhika ahariimwe, tubareeteire engiri ya Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:20">Rom 15:20</ref>. </char></note> Titurikwehimbisiza ha mirimo y'abandi okukira oku turi; kureka twine amatsiko ngu, okwikiriza kwanyu ku kuryeyongyera, itwe turyahimbisibwa omuriimwe aha rugyero oru twagyereirwe, ngu tweyongyere, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Byak 19:21</ref>. </char></note> tubone kubuurira engiri omu mahanga agari seeri y'owaanyu, tutarikwenda kwehimbisa ahabw'ebi twashangire bitebeekanisiibwe omu myanya ehairwe ondiijo. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Mbwenu orikwehimbisa ayehimbisize omuri Mukama; <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:5">1 Kor 4:5</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba orikwehimbisa tiwe aikirizibwa, kureka orikusiimwa Mukama.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Entumwa z'ebishuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Nkaayenzire ngu mungumisiririze kakye omu bushema bwangye; na mbwenu mungumisiririze! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25-27">Efe 5:25-27</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nimbagirira eihato rya Ruhanga, ahabw'okuba nkabahingira Kristo, ngu mbareete omu maisho ge nk'omwishiki oshugaine oku ahingirwa omushaija omwe. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Kwonka nyine obwoba nti: Nk'oku enjoka yaategire Haawa n'obugobya bwayo, ebiteekateeko byanyu bikaahabisibwa, muruga omu muhanda ogurikurahuka kandi ogurikwera oguri omuri Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:8">Gal 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 1:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omuntu ku arikwija yaababuurira Yesu ondiijo, ou tutarababuuriire, nari mwayakiira omwoyo ogundi, ogu mutaraakiire, nari mwaikiriza engiri ey'omuringo ogundi, etari i mwaikiriize, mumwikiriza ahonaaho mutarikubanganisa. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:11">2 Kor 12:11</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:6">Gal 2:6</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 2:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe ningira ngu ezo ntumwa nkuru munonga tiziine ki zirikunkiza na kakye. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />N'obu ndaabe ndi omushema omu kugamba, kwonka tindi mushema mu bwengye; ahakuba omuri byona tukabubooreka butunu omu maisho g'abantu boona.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 9:18">1 Kor 9:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimugira ngu nkakora kubi okwecureeza, ngu imwe mubone kuhimbisibwa ahabw'okubabuurira engiri ya Ruhanga ntarikuheebwa bihembo? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:10">Fil 4:10</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 4:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Nkanyaga amakanisa agandi ningatungaho ebihembo, ngu mbone kubaheereza. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Ku naabaire ndi owaanyu nkyenire, tindaruhize muntu weena omuriimwe, ahakuba ab'eishe-emwe abaarugire Makedonia nibo bampaire ebi naabaire nkyenire. N'ahabw'ekyo nkeerinda kutabarusya omu muringo gwona; na mbwenu niinyija kuguma niinyerinda. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:15">1 Kor 9:15</ref>. </char></note> Nk'amazima ga Kristo oku gari omuriinye, tihariho muntu w'omu byanga bya Akaya orinzibira kwehimbisa ahabw'ekyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Ahabw'enki? N'ahabw'okutabakunda? Ruhanga naabimanya.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Kandi oku nkora, nikwo ndigumizamu ninkora, ngu mbone kwiha orwekwatso ahari abo abarikwenda kuhamya ngu batwaza nkaitwe omu murimo gwabo ogu barikwehimbisizamu. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Mumanye ngu abantu nk'abo n'entumwa z'ebishuba, n'abakozi engobya, abeehindura nk'entumwa za Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Kwonka ekyo ti ky'okutangaaza; ahakuba na Sitaane ayehindura nka maraika w'omushana. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />N'ahabw'ekyo ti ky'okutangaaza abaheereza be kwehindura nk'abaheereza b'okuhikiirira; emperu yaabo eryashemerera ebi baakozire. <verse eid="2CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:6">2 Kor 12:6</ref>. </char></note> Ningaruka kugira nti: Hatagira omuntu omuriimwe orikunteekateekaho ngu ndi omushema; kwonka, ku muraabe nimunteekateekaho mutyo, muunyikirize nk'omushema, mbone kwehimbisaho kakye. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Eki naaza kugamba, tindikukigamba nk'ekigambo kya Mukama, kureka ninkigamba nk'omushema, niinyesiga ngu nyine eki ndikwehimbisiza. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Nk'oku baingi beehimbisa omu by'obuntu nyabuntu, naanye ka nyehimbise. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Ahakuba imwe nk'abanyabwengye mugumisiririza abashema n'okushemererwa! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Mugumisiririza omuntu ku abagira abahuuku, yaabanyaga, yaabakwata n'amaani, yaabeekuzaho, yaabateera empi z'emishaya. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Ebi naabigamba nyine enshoni, ahakuba itwe tukabibaho abeeremwa.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2CO 11:21">Oku Paulo yaabonabonesiibwe</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Mumanye ngu ekirikureetera omuntu weena obumanzi bw'okwehimbisa, naanye nikibundeetera, ningamba nk'omushema. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:5">Fil 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Bo n'Abaheburaayo? Naanye ndi omuheburaayo. Bo n'Abaisraeli? Naanye ndi Omwisraeli. Bo ni baijukuru ba Abrahamu? Naanye ndi omwijukuru. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Bo n'abaheereza ba Kristo? Ningamba nk'omushazi, nyowe nimbakira; nimbakira omu kukora munonga, omu kubohwa kaingi omu kihome, omu kuteerwa enkoba okutarikubarwa, omu kabi k'okufa emirundi mingi. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:3">Bir 25:3</ref>. </char></note> Abayudaaya bakanteera kataano enkoba makumi ashatu na mwenda. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:19">Byak 14:19</ref>. </char></note> Nkateerwa enkoni kashatu; nkateerwa rimwe amabaare. Emeeri ezi naabaire ngyendamu zikacweka kashatu, nindaara omu nyanja, ninsiibamu; <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />omu ngyendo nyingi nkareeba akabi omu migyera, omu bambuzi, omu b'eihanga ryaitu, omu Banyamahanga, omu rurembo, omu ihamba, omu nyanja, omu b'eishe-emwe ab'ebishuba; <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />omu kuruha n'omu kufa kubi, omu kuraara aha kiro kaingi, omu njara n'eiriho, omu kubura eby'okurya kaingi, omu mbeho n'okubura eky'okujwara. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:18-21">Byak 20:18-21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'obu ndaabe ntagambire bindi, hariho ekituura kindemereire n'okwemereza omutima ahabw'amakanisa goona. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />N'oha obura amaani, naanye ntabure maani? N'oha ogwisibwa, kitangwise kubi? <verse eid="2CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:6">2 Kor 12:6</ref>. </char></note> Ku ndaabe nshemereire kwehimbisa, ka nyehimbise ahabw'eby'obweremwa bwangye. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Ruhanga, Ishe wa Mukama waitu Yesu, orikusiimwa ebiro byona, naamanya ku ntarikubeiha. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Omuri Damasiko, omutegyeki w'omugabe Areta akarinda orurembo orwo, ngu ankwate; <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:24">Byak 9:24</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:25">25</ref>. </char></note> kwonka banta omu kitukuru, bandengyeza omu dirisa ey'omu rugo rw'amabaare, naamwoga omu mikono.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Omugisha oguruga omu busaasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Kinshemereire kwehimbisa, n'obu kuraabe kutaine mugasho; kwonka niinyija kugamba eby'okworekwa n'ebi Mukama yanshuururiire. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Nimmanya omuntu ow'omuri Kristo, owaakwatsirwe akatwarwa omu iguru rya kashatu, emyaka ikumi n'ena ehingwire; (yaaba yaabaire ari omu mubiri, nari atari mu mubiri, tindikukimanya; nikimanywa Ruhanga.) <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Kandi nimmanya ngu omuntu ogwo akakwatwa yaatwarwa omuri <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paradiso: reeba Luk 23:43. </char></note>Paradiso, (yaaba yaabaire ari omu mubiri nari atari mu mubiri, tindikumanya; nikimanywa Ruhanga) <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:43">Luk 23:43</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:7">Kush 2:7</ref>. </char></note> yaahurira ebigambo ebitagambwa, ebi omuntu atashemereire kushohoza. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Ka nyehimbise ahabw'omuntu ogwo; kwonka ahabwangye tindikwija kwehimbisa, kureka ahabw'obweremwa bwangye. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Ku naakwenda kwehimbisa, tinkaaba mushema, ahakuba nkaaba ningamba amazima. Kwonka tinkikora, ngu hatagira omuntu owanteekateekaho okukira ebi arikundeebamu n'ebi arikumpuriraho. <verse eid="2CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:6">Yob 2:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ngu ndekye kwehimbisa ahabw'okushuuruurirwa kwingi, okukira oku nshemereire, nkacumitwa eihwa omu mubiri, entumwa ya Sitaane ey'okunteera entomi, ngu ndekye kwehimbisa okukira oku nshemereire. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:44">Mat 26:44</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:26">Bir 3:26</ref>. </char></note> Nkeeshengyereza Mukama kashatu ahabw'ekintu ekyo, ngu kindugyeho. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Yangarukamu ati: Embabazi zangye nizikumara, ahabw'okuba amaani gangye gahikiiririzibwa omu bweremwa. N'ahabw'ekyo niinyija kwehimbisa n'okushemererwa kwingi ahabw'obweremwa bwangye, ngu amaani ga Kristo gabone kungumaho. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:13">Fil 4:13</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ahabwa Kristo ninshemererwa ahabw'obweremwa, omu kujumwa, n'omu bworo, omu kuhiigwa, n'omu busaasi; ahakuba ku mba omweremwa, nibwo ngira amaani.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Mbaire omushema, kwonka niimwe mwakingyemire; ahabw'okuba niimwe mwabaire mushemereire kumpimbisa. Mumanye ngu, n'obu ndaabe ntari kintu, ezo ntumwa nkuru munonga tiziine ki zankirize na kakye. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Buzimazima ebirikuhamya entumwa nkabikorera omuriimwe omu kugumisiriza kwingi, ninkora obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza n'eby'amaani. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Amakanisa agandi gakabakiza ki? Kureka nyowe okutabarusya. Munsaasire ekishobyo ekyo!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Mbwenu nyeteekateekire kwija owaanyu omurundi gwa kashatu; kwonka tindibarusya, ahakuba tindikwenda byanyu, kureka niimwe ndikwenda; nimumanya ngu abaana tibo bashemereire kubiikira abazire baabo, kureka abazaire nibo babiikira abaana. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Ahabwangye ndyashemererwa munonga kuhayo ebyangye, kandi n'okwehayo nyeheyo ahabw'amagara gaanyu. Obu mbakunzire munonga, nibwo nkunzirwe kakye. <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Imwe nimugira ngu okubarusya tindabaruhize; ngu kwonka nkabaitsa obwengye, naabagobeza. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Beitu shi, omuri abo abu naabatumireho hariho oine eki yaabaanyihiireho? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:6">2 Kor 8:6</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 8:16-18">16-18</ref>. </char></note> Nkeeshengyereza Tito kwija owaanyu, naamutuma n'ow'eishe-emwe ogwo. Mbwenu Tito aine eki yaabaihireho? Tituratoire ekirari kimwe? <verse eid="2CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Okuruga ira n'okuhitsya hati muteekateeka ngu nitwerwanaho ahariimwe? Mumanye ngu ebi tugamba tubigambira omuri Kristo omu maisho ga Ruhanga, kandi byona, abarikukundwa munonga, tubigamba ahabw'okubombeka. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:6">1 Kor 4:6</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka eki ndikutiina shana nikwo kwija, nkashanga mutari nk'oku ndikwenda, kandi naimwe mukandeeba ndi oku mutarikwenda; kandi shana mwine entongane, eihari, ekiniga, empaka, okugambuurana, okuhwihwitsa, okwekuza, n'omurabanamu; <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />kandi ngu, ku ndiija, Ruhanga wangye aryancureeza omu maisho gaanyu, naanye nsaasibwe baingi abaasiisire kare, bateeteise bihagaro n'obushambani n'okurigirana okubi, ebi baakozire.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 19:15">Bir 19:15</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:19">1 Tim 5:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hati ogu n'omurundi gwa kashatu ogu ndikwenda kwija owaanyu. Buri kigambo kishemereire kuhamibwa baakareebi babiri nari bashatu. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Obu naabaire ndi owaanyu obwa kabiri, nkabateisa; na mbwenu n'obu ntari okwo, nimbateisa ntakaizire, nti: Abo abaasiisire n'abandi boona, ku ndiba naizire, tindibasaasira; <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />ahakuba musherura ekirikuhamya ngu Kristo niwe angambisa. We ti mweremwa ahariimwe, kureka n'Ow'amaani omuriimwe, <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:7">Fil 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 2:8">8</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba akabambirwa omu bweremwa, kwonka ariho ahuriire ahabw'amaani ga Ruhanga. Naitwe turi abeeremwa omuriwe, kwonka turyaba abahuriire nawe omu bi turibakorera ahabw'amaani ga Ruhanga.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 11:28">1 Kor 11:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mweshwijume, mureebe ku muraabe muri omu kwikiriza; kandi mwegyeze mwenka. Nari ahabwanyu timurikwemanya mwenka, ku Yesu Kristo ari omuriimwe kureka biri muri abatarikwikirizibwa? <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Kwonka nyine amatsiko ngu nimwija kumanya ku tutari batarikwikirizibwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Kandi nitushaba Ruhanga ngu murekye kukora ekibi, ti habwe okugira ngu itwe tureebekye nitusiimwa, kureka n'okubendeza ngu mukore ebihikire, n'obu twakureebeka nk'abatarikwikirizibwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Mumanye ngu titurikubaasa kurwanisa amazima, kureka okugarwanirira. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Nikitushemeza itwe kuba abeeremwa, imwe mukaba ab'amaani; eki turikubashabira n'eki, ngu mube abarikuhikiririzibwa kimwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 10:8">2 Kor 10:8</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo naahandiikira ebi ntakaizire, ngu ku ndiba naizire, ndekye kutwaza amaani n'obushoboorozi obu naahairwe Mukama obw'okubombeka, butari bw'okubasheenya.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Eky'aha muheru, B'eishe-emwe, mugumeho. Muhikiririzibwe kimwe, muhuguurane, mugire omutima gumwe, mugume n'obusingye; obwo nibwo Ruhanga ow'okukunda n'obusingye ariguma naimwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Muramukanise okunywegyera okurikwera. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Abarikwera boona baabaramutsya.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, n'okukunda kwa Ruhanga, n'okukwatanisa kw'Omwoyo Orikwera bigume naimwe mwena.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>